---
term: Fundamental protections
aka:
  - Level 0
layer: L0
section: evolution-and-protection
order: 40
definition: The deepest [[constitutional layering|constitutional layer]], which protects membership, exit, basic agency, and resistance to capture.
seeAlso:
  - anti-capture-protection
  - exit
  - meta-governance
---
Fundamental protections are the hardest provisions to change. They preserve the conditions that make every future democratic amendment legitimate.
